y":"HOURLY_AUDIT/v1\n\nSemantic verdict reconciled: STOP (valid scientific negative result; do not rerun).\n\nDurable evidence:\n- TASK_COMPLETED bound to lease `5ca8701b3d4f4f64ad323f60f5ec2286`, source `d3835c30db460044b50da3dfe19f7c492f1d9e5892642f9f82a48600caa8ac91`.\n- Review PR #87 exact head `cbdbb972b6fa0f89d15bbd900b65e38c293d5d8a` remains open/unmerged.\n- Corpus: 34 public incidents / 7 repair families.\n- RAW retrieval: top-1 64.7%, top-3 88.2%.\n- behavioral S: top-1 52.9%, top-3 70.6%.\n- redaction proxy: 13,977 -> 235 tokens (98.3% reduction), 2,186 high-specificity spans removed.\n- Wise Broker cross-project test: no advantage; S still underperformed RAW.\n- No model was invoked, so no model/token usage counters exist to record.\n\nInterpretation: the tested fixed lexical behavioral signature is too lossy for useful repair-family retrieval. This falsifies this v1 encoder, not the broader semantic-tensor hypothesis. No successor is justified from this run alone; a future continuation should require an independently labeled/preregistered corpus and a genuinely different encoder rather than expanding S until it leaks R.\n\nQueue consequence: #86 is scientifically complete; treat it as settled portfolio evidence and free the Wolfram WIP slot. Do not merge PR #87 automatically.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/comments/5634212986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com